@startuml component
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Client" {
  [Web Browser / UI] as UI
}

package "Backend" {
  [API Controller] as API
  [Input Validation Service] as Validation
  [Security / Policy Module] as Policy
  [Metrics Service] as Metrics
  [Result Service] as Result
  [Evaluation Service] as Evaluation
}

database "Temporary Storage" as Storage

UI --> API : HTTP/JSON + multipart
API --> Validation : validate inputs
API --> Policy : policy/access checks
Validation --> Policy : limits / allowlists
API --> Evaluation : validated evaluation
API --> Result : status/results/download
Evaluation --> Metrics : predictions + targets
Metrics --> Result : metrics
' norank keeps this edge from reshuffling the layout
API -[norank]-> Storage : validated uploads
Evaluation --> Storage : temporary artifacts
Result --> Storage : results
@enduml
